    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>OrePlant: A Magical Fantasy World Awaits!</strong> \u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious <strong>Finn\u00a0</strong>and <strong>Maru</strong> are drawn into a magical fantasy world by a mysterious force! \ud83c\udf00 There, the legendary <strong>World Tree</strong> stands tall, and your touch will gradually bring this mystical land back to life. \ud83c\udf33 With the help of your adorable companion, <strong>Aria</strong>, explore and nurture this enchanting world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/20e7c828d18c26340ef60e81f7cdda01.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=2321 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/faa6f6bc03860841c38b06262068bb47.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=1999 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=5 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udc8e <strong>The Charm of Idle Gameplay</strong></u><br><br>A <strong>&quot;salary thief&quot; game</strong> where characters do all the work for you! \ud83d\udcb8<br>Enjoy the game even while working with <strong>Picture-in-Picture (PIP) mode</strong>! \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\ud83d\udccb<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/32fe98676103bb51c47a34c719df50ce.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/32fe98676103bb51c47a34c719df50ce.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/32fe98676103bb51c47a34c719df50ce.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing Content with the Adorable 'Dambi'</strong></u><br><br>You're not fishing alone! The cute weasel <strong>\u2018Dambi\u2019</strong> is here to help. \ud83e\udda6\ud83d\udc96<br>Relax by the water and enjoy a peaceful fishing experience with Dambi.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Automated Robots to Assist You</strong></u><br><br>Adorable <strong>automation robots</strong> will help cultivate minerals! \u26cf\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3f<br>Increase work efficiency and manage your farm more effectively.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Diverse Cooking System</strong></u><br><br>Use harvested minerals, crops, and fish to create a variety of <strong>delicious dishes</strong>!<br>Cooked meals provide <strong>useful buffs</strong> to your characters. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\u2728<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Exciting Story and Cinematic Presentation</strong></u><br><br>A <strong>heartwarming and immersive story</strong> awaits!<br>Join adorable and charming characters on an <strong>engaging adventure</strong> with captivating visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/9acc5182047f806a5a2546be64eb0df1.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/9acc5182047f806a5a2546be64eb0df1.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/9acc5182047f806a5a2546be64eb0df1.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Customize Your Own Farm</strong></u><br><br>Create a <strong>cozy and unique</strong> space in your own style! \ud83c\udf33\u2728<br>Decorate with various items and turn your farm into a <strong>stunning background</strong>! \ud83c\udf04<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=5 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Recommended For</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love relaxing and healing games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of adorable graphics and creative customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy diverse gameplay styles like farming, fishing, and cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of games like Stardew Valley or Rusty Retirement will absolutely love it!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>OrePlant</strong> invites you to unleash your creativity and bring a magical world back to life! \ud83c\udf08<br><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Your story begins beneath the legendary World Tree. \ud83c\udf1f</strong></p>",
