apps/3377860/extras/9acc5182047f806a5a2546be64eb0df1.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Customize Your Own Farm</strong></u><br><br>Create a <strong>cozy and unique</strong> space in your own style! \ud83c\udf33\u2728<br>Decorate with various items and turn your farm into a <strong>stunning background</strong>! \ud83c\udf04<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.poster.avif?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.webm?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/962816e568a73621fc8fb0c84f9ebc4d.mp4?t=1748837318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=5 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Recommended For</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love relaxing and healing games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of adorable graphics and creative customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy diverse gameplay styles like farming, fishing, and cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of games like Stardew Valley or Rusty Retirement will absolutely love it!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1748837318\" width=800 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>OrePlant</strong> invites you to unleash your creativity and bring a magical world back to life! \ud83c\udf08<br><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Your story begins beneath the legendary World Tree. \ud83c\udf1f</strong></p>",
